      "foundedYear": 1958,
      "parentCompany": null,
      "shortDescription": "Yılmaz Redüktör manufactures industrial gear units, geared motors and drive-control equipment in Türkiye. Its range includes helical, shaft-mounted, helical-bevel, worm, planetary, heavy-duty industrial and hoist-drive gearboxes, together with motor and frequency-drive configurations.",
      "fullDescription": [
        "Yılmaz Redüktör Sanayi ve Ticaret A.Ş. is a Turkish power-transmission manufacturer founded by Mesut Yılmaz in 1958. Official company materials identify its head office and gearbox manufacturing operation in Istanbul and document serial gearbox production as the company's core specialisation since 1963.",
        "The official product structure covers inline helical, shaft-mounted helical, helical-bevel, worm and planetary gear units, as well as heavy-duty parallel-shaft and bevel-helical industrial gearboxes and dedicated hoist-drum drives. Products are offered in motorised, motor-ready and shaft-input arrangements, with options for electric or hydraulic motors, brakes, cooling, backstops, encoders and variable-frequency drives. Published applications include cranes and lifting systems, mobile machinery, conveyors, mixers, extruders, rolling mills, construction equipment and wind-turbine mechanisms."
      ],
