      "shortDescription": "Airtech Vacuum designs and manufactures vacuum pumps, regenerative blowers, compressors and engineered vacuum or compressed-air systems. The company is headquartered in Rutherford, New Jersey, and operates as part of IDEX Corporation's Health & Science Technologies segment.",
      "fullDescription": [
        "Airtech Vacuum Incorporated is a United States pressure-technology manufacturer established in 1982 and headquartered in Rutherford, New Jersey. Airtech became part of IDEX Corporation in 2021 and continues to operate as a distinct manufacturer within the group's Health & Science Technologies segment.",
        "Airtech's official portfolio includes oil-free, dry rotary-vane, oil-flooded rotary-vane, liquid-ring, rotary-claw and dry-piston vacuum pumps; regenerative and variable-speed blowers; vacuum boosters; oil-less compressors; and complete vacuum or compressed-air systems. The company also develops customised engineered packages and supplies parts and accessories. Published applications span HVAC, printing and paper, pneumatic conveying, automotive, electronics, food and beverage, chemicals, plastics, packaging, environmental systems, and medical and dental equipment."
